      "html": "<ul><li>In an AI health and safety inspection, the AI handles the paperwork: it listens to your voice notes, reads your photos, puts each answer under the right question and writes the report.</li><li>The person on the job still does the inspecting and decides what is found.</li><li>At Ethos Safety the write-up went from 1 to 2 hours down to 14 minutes on average, around 80% faster.</li><li>The law still expects a competent person (Management of Health and Safety at Work Regulations 1999, regulation 7, checked 17 November 2026).</li></ul>"
